#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top_common.py:64
msgid ""
"Change lanes without the need to nudge the steering wheel first.\n"
"Disabled: Need to nudge the steering wheel to change lanes.\n"
"Enabled: Nudgeless.\n"
"Speed limit: Normal mode: above 20mph, Enabled Lateral Controls Always On: above 35mph."
msgstr ""
"打方向燈即自動變換車道，變換車道不再需要先輕推方向盤。\n"
"關閉選項:  需輕推方向盤啟動換道。\n"
"開啟選項:  不需輕推方向盤即可換道。\n"
"換道速度限制: 一般模式：時速32公里以上, 開啟全時置中功能：時速65公里以上。"

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top_common.py:106
msgid ""
"Change the ACC +/- buttons behavior with cruise speed change in openpilot.\n"
"Disabled (Stock): Short = 1, Long = 5.\n"
"Enabled: Short and Long = 5."
msgstr ""
"在openpilot中更改ACC +/- 按鈕的行為與巡航速度變化。\n"
"關閉選項 (原廠設定): 短按 = 1, 長按 = 5。\n"
"開啟選項: 短按及長按 = 5。"

